        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>This game is still actively evolving. Expect updates, fixes, and improvements. Your support goes a long way</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virago World</strong> is a cozy yet thrilling farming and life simulation game with a unique psychological twist. By day, plant and grow beautiful flowers, work shifts at Tall Lady Victoria’s flower shop, and design houses using the blossoms you nurture. Befriend townspeople by gifting them your prized flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joining you on your journey is <strong>Ollie</strong>, a gentle yet fiercely loyal bear and Willow’s best friend. Whether you’re gardening in the sun or wandering through town, Ollie is always by your side, offering comfort and protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, <strong>Virago World transforms</strong>. Stalkers lurk in the darkness, and the peaceful town becomes a place of danger. With Ollie at your side, evade the shadows and survive until morning. Balance your tranquil farming life with the thrilling challenge of staying safe after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.poster.avif?t=1764453619\" width=690 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.webm?t=1764453619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.mp4?t=1764453619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> <br>• Grow and harvest a wide variety of flowers <br>• Decorate and customize houses with your own floral designs  <br>• Your pet bear best friend Ollie protecting you<br>• Survive the night by avoiding stalkers who emerge in the dark <br>• Work at Victoria’s flower shop to sell your creations and develop your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mental Health Notice:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>While Virago World explores moments of fear, loneliness and recovery, we encourage players to prioritize their own well being. If anything in the game feels heavy, step away and take a break, and if you’re struggling, reach out to someone you trust.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>This game is still actively evolving. Expect updates, fixes, and improvements. Your support goes a long way</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Virago World</strong> is a cozy yet thrilling farming and life simulation game with a unique psychological twist. By day, plant and grow beautiful flowers, work shifts at Tall Lady Victoria’s flower shop, and design houses using the blossoms you nurture. Befriend townspeople by gifting them your prized flowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joining you on your journey is <strong>Ollie</strong>, a gentle yet fiercely loyal bear and Willow’s best friend. Whether you’re gardening in the sun or wandering through town, Ollie is always by your side, offering comfort and protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as night falls, <strong>Virago World transforms</strong>. Stalkers lurk in the darkness, and the peaceful town becomes a place of danger. With Ollie at your side, evade the shadows and survive until morning. Balance your tranquil farming life with the thrilling challenge of staying safe after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.poster.avif?t=1764453619\" width=690 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.webm?t=1764453619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854600/extras/28d848177ef9d55798293e45257a74ba.mp4?t=1764453619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> <br>• Grow and harvest a wide variety of flowers <br>• Decorate and customize houses with your own floral designs  <br>• Your pet bear best friend Ollie protecting you<br>• Survive the night by avoiding stalkers who emerge in the dark <br>• Work at Victoria’s flower shop to sell your creations and develop your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Mental Health Notice:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>While Virago World explores moments of fear, loneliness and recovery, we encourage players to prioritize their own well being. If anything in the game feels heavy, step away and take a break, and if you’re struggling, reach out to someone you trust.</i></p>",
